{
  "name": "Wax Documents Standard",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "configure",
        "trigger": "documents",
        "folders": {
          "folderValues": [
            {
              "folder": "/home/delorenj/d/Inbox/Wax"
            }
          ]
        },
        "failurePolicy": "independent",
        "enabled": true,
        "description": "Active Wax-owned new-arrival Markdown enrichment from ~/d/Inbox/Wax; existing files are seeded, never backfilled.",
        "version": 2
      },
      "id": "wax-doc-wrapper",
      "name": "Wax Pipeline",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-heyma.waxPipeline",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -360,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "wax-doc-classify",
      "name": "Classify",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-heyma.wax-pass-classification",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "when": "[{\"field\":\"classification\",\"exists\":true}]"
      },
      "id": "wax-doc-title",
      "name": "Title",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-heyma.wax-pass-title-slug",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        220,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "wax-doc-projects",
      "name": "Projects",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-heyma.wax-pass-project-extraction",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Wax Documents Standard\n\nBoth ports are stock MAIN. Output 0 'continue' only orders; output 1 'requires' gates: Title is wired from Classify's requires port, so Title waits for \u2014 and is blocked by the failure of \u2014 Classify.\n\nProjects (project-extraction) is an independent pass: it keeps a note's existing project-ids and otherwise asks Jev which pjangler projects the note talks about.\n\nClassify (v2) may abstain on a document; it then stores `other`, so Title still runs.\n\nThis workflow is an AUTHORING artifact. `wax pipeline import` compiles it into a frozen, versioned pipeline; n8n never executes it.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 380
      },
      "id": "wax-doc-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -360,
        160
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Classify": {
      "main": [
        [],
        [
          {
            "node": "Title",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  }
}
